  "body": "## What's Changed\n* ⬆️ Bump @babel/preset-env from 7.26.9 to 7.27.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1425\n* ⬆️ Bump @babel/preset-flow from 7.25.9 to 7.27.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1426\n* ⬆️ Bump @babel/core from 7.26.10 to 7.27.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1427\n* ⬆️ Bump typescript from 5.8.2 to 5.8.3 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1433\n* ⬆️ Bump @babel/preset-typescript from 7.27.0 to 7.27.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1428\n* ⬆️ Bump flow-bin from 0.266.1 to 0.269.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1432\n* ⬆️ Bump turbo from 2.4.4 to 2.5.2 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1430\n* ⬆️ Bump hermes-eslint from 0.26.0 to 0.28.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1431\n* ⬆️ Bump @babel/cli from 7.27.0 to 7.27.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/pull/1434\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carloscuesta/gitmoji-cli/compare/v9.6.0...v9.7.0",
